136+  0084              ; CRC-16/CCITT-FALSE byte update for the shared P126 DMA/IPC frame ABI.
137+  0084              ; IN : HL=current CRC, A=next byte.
138+  0084              ; OUT: HL=updated CRC. BC and DE are preserved.
139+  0084              ; The caller initializes HL to #FFFF and processes header[0..15]
140+  0084              ; followed by exactly payload_length bytes.
